It took you long enough.

272
00:16:27,660 --> 00:16:35,340
What the hell?

273
00:16:35,460 --> 00:16:36,880
What do you think you're doing with him?

274
00:16:38,460 --> 00:16:40,320
Oh, it's not what you think, Mitsu.

275
00:16:41,000 --> 00:16:44,920
I was just explaining to him that a vampire bit me the other day.

276
00:16:45,500 --> 00:16:45,640
Oh.

277
00:16:47,040 --> 00:16:47,660
Hold up.

278
00:16:47,720 --> 00:16:48,880
You've got a bandage, too?

279
00:16:49,580 --> 00:16:50,420
Are you okay?

280
00:16:51,600 --> 00:16:51,840
Huh?

281
00:16:52,600 --> 00:16:53,000
Uh.

282
00:16:53,680 --> 00:16:54,640
Yeah, I'm fine.

283
00:16:54,740 --> 00:16:55,060
Thanks.

284
00:16:56,800 --> 00:16:58,500
Why don't you use your inside voice?

285
00:16:58,600 --> 00:16:59,080
You're in the hospital.

286
00:16:59,100 --> 00:17:00,020
Who do you think you are?

287
00:17:00,140 --> 00:17:01,380
He looks just fine to me.

288
00:17:01,720 --> 00:17:03,020
Did you enjoy your little nap?

289
00:17:04,200 --> 00:17:05,280
Were you concerned?

290
00:17:05,760 --> 00:17:06,160
Huh?

291
00:17:06,560 --> 00:17:09,740
Why would I waste my valuable time worrying about you, dumbass?

292
00:17:10,080 --> 00:17:11,320
Don't try to act tough.

293
00:17:11,320 --> 00:17:12,900
We all know you were worried.

294
00:17:12,900 --> 00:17:16,020
After all, you spent quite a bit of time sitting by his bed.

295
00:17:17,380 --> 00:17:17,860
What?

296
00:17:18,160 --> 00:17:20,040
Okay, now you're just making stuff up.

297
00:17:20,300 --> 00:17:21,980
I was never in here watching him sleep.

298
00:17:22,220 --> 00:17:24,820
I thought you said not to tell him about watching him sleep.

299
00:17:24,940 --> 00:17:25,560
Shut up.

300
00:17:29,060 --> 00:17:30,780
Hey, listen up, guys.

301
00:17:31,300 --> 00:17:32,380
I want to say something.

302
00:17:33,080 --> 00:17:33,560
What?

303
00:17:34,080 --> 00:17:34,740
Spit it out.

304
00:17:35,440 --> 00:17:35,800
Sure.

305
00:17:37,240 --> 00:17:38,120
Go on.

306
00:17:42,900 --> 00:17:44,660
It's no big.

307
00:17:45,060 --> 00:17:50,220
I just wanted to say thank you and to apologize for sleeping so long.

308
00:17:51,820 --> 00:17:55,080
You know, I'm lucky to have all of you.

309
00:17:55,080 --> 00:18:04,560
Call a doctor.

310
00:18:05,120 --> 00:18:07,200
He obviously still needs medical attention.

311
00:18:07,440 --> 00:18:07,740
Yep.

312
00:18:08,060 --> 00:18:09,820
He definitely hit his head or something.

313
00:18:10,140 --> 00:18:10,940
I don't think so.

314
00:18:11,180 --> 00:18:13,200
He was actually been a good guy from the beginning.

315
00:18:13,340 --> 00:18:15,120
Well, I hope he hasn't lost his nerve.

316
00:18:15,360 --> 00:18:16,640
He's starting to sound pathetic.

317
00:18:16,900 --> 00:18:19,320
I'm going to kick all of your asses.

318
00:18:20,000 --> 00:18:22,360
Anyway, we've got plenty of time to rest.

319
00:18:22,760 --> 00:18:24,900
It's good that we get a little downtime to heal.

320
00:18:26,580 --> 00:18:27,580
What do you mean?

321
00:18:28,240 --> 00:18:29,000
That's right.

322
00:18:29,300 --> 00:18:31,420
We're on hiatus until you recover.

323
00:18:32,080 --> 00:18:34,500
The Shinawa Hiragi squad is taking a break.

324
00:18:35,940 --> 00:18:36,980
A break, huh?

325
00:18:36,980 --> 00:18:47,500
I know you're probably anxious to go after Mika, but you'll need to regain your strength first.

326
00:18:48,120 --> 00:18:48,740
You're right.

327
00:18:49,580 --> 00:18:52,120
I'll take it easy and behave for the time being.

328
00:18:53,200 --> 00:18:55,280
I don't want to cause any more trouble.

329
00:18:59,080 --> 00:19:00,040
Any requests?

330
00:19:00,580 --> 00:19:02,360
I'm going to go pick up some drinks for us.

331
00:19:02,760 --> 00:19:04,000
That's our Kameezuki.

332
00:19:04,360 --> 00:19:06,540
Always trying to take care of his family.

333
00:19:06,980 --> 00:19:08,540
Never mind.

334
00:19:09,540 --> 00:19:10,580
Wait, I'll come with you.

335
00:19:11,020 --> 00:19:12,220
You only have two hands.

336
00:19:12,880 --> 00:19:18,600
And on the opposite end of the spectrum, we have Mitsu, who doesn't have a nurturing bone in her body.

337
00:19:18,760 --> 00:19:19,860
Hold it right there.

338
00:19:19,920 --> 00:19:22,060
I don't exactly see you playing team mom.

339
00:19:23,060 --> 00:19:25,520
I don't have to because I'm the team leader.

340
00:19:25,520 --> 00:19:43,060
I don't even know what to say.

341
00:19:43,060 --> 00:19:43,640
Yeah.

342
00:19:43,640 --> 00:19:59,960
None of my friends got seriously hurt.

343
00:20:01,300 --> 00:20:02,460
Mika is still alive.

344
00:20:03,540 --> 00:20:04,600
It's unbelievable.

345
00:20:05,500 --> 00:20:07,760
Why are so many good things happening to me?

346
00:20:09,600 --> 00:20:11,440
He's out there, somewhere.

347
00:20:11,440 --> 00:20:15,800
And I'll find him again, Mika.

348
00:20:19,160 --> 00:20:20,040
You.

349
00:20:26,180 --> 00:20:28,180
I'll do whatever it takes.

350
00:20:28,520 --> 00:20:29,920
I swear on everything.

351
00:20:31,460 --> 00:20:32,880
I'll save you.

352
00:20:41,440 --> 00:20:49,160
I'll do whatever it takes.

353
00:20:49,160 --> 00:20:51,160
I'll do whatever it takes.

354
00:20:51,160 --> 00:21:13,760
Don't you find it amusing that things seem to be going so smoothly?

355
00:21:14,220 --> 00:21:17,720
As usual, the humans' lust for power is out of control.

356
00:21:18,080 --> 00:21:21,540
And we vampires are so arrogant that we take things too lightly.

357
00:21:23,260 --> 00:21:25,000
Wouldn't you agree with me?

358
00:21:25,120 --> 00:21:27,380
Or does my partner see things differently?

359
00:21:28,580 --> 00:21:30,140
You're so serious.

360
00:21:30,660 --> 00:21:31,400
Here you go.

361
00:21:31,800 --> 00:21:33,480
All of our research data.

362
00:21:33,480 --> 00:21:35,580
One more thing.

363
00:21:35,920 --> 00:21:36,860
I almost forgot.

364
00:21:36,860 --> 00:21:37,000
I almost forgot.

365
00:21:37,000 --> 00:21:53,960
He's fine.

366
00:21:54,360 --> 00:21:55,200
I'm trying.

367
00:21:55,200 --> 00:21:55,220
I'm trying.

368
00:21:55,220 --> 00:21:56,540
I'm trying.

369
00:21:56,540 --> 00:22:26,520
作詞・作曲・編曲 初音ミク

370
00:22:26,540 --> 00:22:56,520
